tial ornamentation, as if this is a sacred hidden court in a dream realm. Use a refined color palette dominated by sapphire blue, cobalt, turquoise, pale green, ivory, gold, and soft black. The lighting should feel radiant and magical, with glowing highlights on water surfaces, delicate bloom around flowers, shimmering reflections, and a painterly anime-fantasy finish.\n\nThe image should feel richly decorative, elegant, slightly decadent, and deeply immersive, like a luxurious fantasy character illustration merged with a mythic garden world. Emphasize floral abundance, layered environmental depth, reflective surfaces, ornate kimono textures, clean facial beauty, and a strong cinematic widescreen composition with the woman as the central anchor of the scene. Highly detailed, artstation-quality fantasy illustration, no text, no logo, no watermark."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 159, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [5844.60595703125, 2440.805908203125], "id": 90, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [270, 290], "pos": [12907.953125, 2146.142578125], "widgets_values": ["KSK_Krea2_SplitSigmas_RAWHigh_TurboLow"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 158, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 89, "type": "SaveImage